;;;    SDTKBLOCK : thong ke block (ke ca block dong: visibility, tham so) + thuoc tinh -> bang + CSV;
;;;                gan hang loat gia tri thuoc tinh / tham so block dong (co {n} danh so)
;;;    SDXREF    : bao cao Xref (da nap / chua nap / khong tim thay, duong dan), doi sang duong dan tuong doi,
;;;                tim lai Xref mat duong dan, nap lai
;;;    SDDMBV    : danh muc ban ve (Sheet List) tu Layout / khung ten: so hieu, ten, ty le, phien ban -> bang + CSV
